    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/cd1190d43f73f56b2eb6a41a3d6df01a.avif?t=1745507731\" width=599 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mare is a unique fast-paced gripping survival horror game that mixes classic ghost story with a nerve-wracking survival horror experience. Prey that you will survive the evil forces that lurks in the shadows of this grand mansion. Move carefully, and hide when you can. Run as fast as you can, but for all the world don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young boy trapped in an old mansion. In the game you can navigate through many of the rooms and corridors in the house, while trying to find clues and objects that are needed for the story to progress.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/1504184d6fa08fe81e84642d785f8bf2.webp?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth to avoid drawing attention from enemies. If necessary, hide under tables, beds or inside wardrobes. You can even use an old radio receiver that reveals the enemy's location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, run, run, RUN! ...and maybe a little bit of crouching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with doors and drawers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide inside or under different kinds of furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate enemies and and see which doors can be opened using a scanning mechanism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid getting lost by using a map<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/ba7c179a5522d258be9837461e41fd6f.webp?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is full of dark rooms and corridors that must be explored for the story to progresses. To gain access to the various rooms, you must first find the keys that fit the specific doors.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/cd1190d43f73f56b2eb6a41a3d6df01a.avif?t=1745507731\" width=599 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mare is a unique fast-paced gripping survival horror game that mixes classic ghost story with a nerve-wracking survival horror experience. Prey that you will survive the evil forces that lurks in the shadows of this grand mansion. Move carefully, and hide when you can. Run as fast as you can, but for all the world don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2383d1c8d4b445541f83d0cc39a026d9.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young boy trapped in an old mansion. In the game you can navigate through many of the rooms and corridors in the house, while trying to find clues and objects that are needed for the story to progress.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/1504184d6fa08fe81e84642d785f8bf2.webp?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/26fd19e01f5368a8f533f31865cfb413.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth to avoid drawing attention from enemies. If necessary, hide under tables, beds or inside wardrobes. You can even use an old radio receiver that reveals the enemy's location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, run, run, RUN! ...and maybe a little bit of crouching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with doors and drawers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide inside or under different kinds of furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate enemies and and see which doors can be opened using a scanning mechanism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid getting lost by using a map<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/ba7c179a5522d258be9837461e41fd6f.webp?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.poster.avif?t=1745507731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.webm?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.mp4?t=1745507731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is full of dark rooms and corridors that must be explored for the story to progresses. To gain access to the various rooms, you must first find the keys that fit the specific doors.  </p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game where you play as a young boy trapped in a sinister, abandoned mansion plagued by vengeful spirits and haunting secrets. You'll need to rely on your wits to run from lurking dangers, unlock chilling new areas, and seek refuge in wardrobes to evade capture.",
